ss=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementaryExtension}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementaryExtension}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}extension\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryExtension}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}extension\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\mathcal N\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryExtension}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Elementary extension: all first-order statements preserved and reflected</li>\n<li>Tarski–Vaught 判据是该定义的等价判据，应单列为定理而不是第二个定义。</li>\n<li>初等链定理给出每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_i\\preceq\\bigcup_j\\mathcal M_j\">\\(\\mathcal M_i\\preceq\\bigcup_j\\mathcal M_j\\)</span>；原文件把包含方向写反。</li>\n<li>Scott normal form: any countable structure has <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>-saturated elementary extension</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Chang and Keisler, Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]"